 "omitted": "A 只收了 Handouts 里分好单元的 7 个单元（Kinematics-1/2、Jacobian、Robots and Vision、Trajectory Planning、Dynamics、Control）；讲义里“Course Introduction”（Lecture 1，课程概览与历史视频）以及不在这些单元里的 Lecture 16（柔顺与力控制、任务姿态与全身控制）没收录，作业与试卷也不收。B 的课表 21 讲里只收了与定位建图/感知融合直接相关的 8 讲，Homogenous Coordinates、Unscented Kalman Filter、Extended Information Filter、Sparse EIF SLAM、Summary on the Kalman Filter and its Friends for SLAM、Grid-Based SLAM with Rao-Blackwellized Particle Filters、Least-Squares、Hierarchical Pose-Graphs for Online Mapping、Graph-Based SLAM with Landmarks、Max-Mixture and Robust Least Squares for SLAM、Stochastic Gradient Descent for SLAM、Short Summary 等属具体算法变体或总结，未收。",
